    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Tax Calculation API provides the functionality to retrieve applicable tax information for items in a user's shopping cart. This API serves as a crucial tool for online retailers seeking to ensure compliance with tax regulations and enhance the customer checkout experience. By accessing tax details based on the cart's contents, merchants can accurately calculate total costs for consumers. Typical users of this API include ecommerce platforms and shopping cart systems aiming to provide transparent pricing.",
